# connect-src bevat https://app.honeybadgertrader.com bewust: geplande terugkeer waitlist naar Flask API (fetch); niet verwijderen zonder audit — zie docs/WAITLIST-API-SPEC.md
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://plausible.io; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com data:; connect-src 'self' https://app.honeybadgertrader.com https://plausible.io https://fonts.googleapis.com https://fonts.gstatic.com
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
